WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.167
-Oh, yes.
Oh, it's so good to be here.

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:05.534
Look at me out here
dressed like Ellen.

00:00:05.534 --> 00:00:07.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:09.300
Oh, yeah, yeah.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:13.167
Oh, man. I'm celebrating 'cause
today marks 23 years

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:15.100
of me being not sober.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:19.567
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah, yeah.

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:21.934
And if you're sober,
I'm a people pleaser,

00:00:21.934 --> 00:00:23.634
so, oh, my God, me too.

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:25.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:28.467
I'm so sober for several hours
a day.

00:00:28.467 --> 00:00:31.801
And then the day gets better.

00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:34.000
I have friends that judge
my drinking.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.033
They're like,
"You know, that stuff

00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:36.334
will take years off your life."

00:00:36.334 --> 00:00:38.100
I'm like,
"Eh, not the good ones."

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.834 --> 00:00:42.133
Come on, I'm not going to treat
these good years hoping to get

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:45.501
those years where I lose control
of my bodily faculties,

00:00:45.501 --> 00:00:48.067
I forget everything, and I fall
down everywhere I go

00:00:48.067 --> 00:00:50.868
when I can enjoy all of that
right now.

00:00:50.868 --> 00:00:52.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:54.267
Thanks to drinking. Yeah.

00:00:54.267 --> 00:00:55.868
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah.

00:00:58.834 --> 00:01:01.234
I trust drinkers.
They're fun, you know?

00:01:01.234 --> 00:01:02.667
I saw a guy with a hat
on the other day.

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:04.133
It said, "I'm an alcoholic.

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:06.434
My favorite thing in the world
is drinking outdoors

00:01:06.434 --> 00:01:08.968
and I want everyone to know it."

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:11.400
Well, it didn't say all that.
It just said "Yeti."

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:18.033 --> 00:01:20.167
But that's what it meant.

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:22.834
Come on, nobody loves "coolers"
that much.

00:01:22.834 --> 00:01:24.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:25.901
That's like somebody
who loves nose candy

00:01:25.901 --> 00:01:27.601
wearing a hat that says
"mirrors."

00:01:27.601 --> 00:01:32.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:33.067 --> 00:01:34.734
Thank you.

00:01:34.734 --> 00:01:36.534
I have the body of a drinker.

00:01:36.534 --> 00:01:38.601
I got a little tummy.
I shouldn't have a tummy.

00:01:38.601 --> 00:01:40.734
I take long walks almost
every single morning,

00:01:40.734 --> 00:01:42.934
you know, to go get my car.
And --

00:01:42.934 --> 00:01:45.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.601
But, no, I have a little tummy.
I got a double chin.

00:01:47.601 --> 00:01:50.167
Does anybody in here have the --
Look at this.

00:01:50.167 --> 00:01:51.501
[ Laughter ]
Yeah, look at me.

00:01:51.501 --> 00:01:53.000
I'm Chinning Tatum. You know?

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.667 --> 00:01:56.968
But I like my double chin.
It keeps me safe, right?

00:01:56.968 --> 00:02:00.734
You couldn't put me in
a headlock, right?

00:02:00.734 --> 00:02:02.701
Try to put me in a headlock.
You'd be like, "I got ya."

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:03.834
I'd be like, "Nope."

00:02:03.834 --> 00:02:05.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.968 --> 00:02:07.667
Couldn't do it.
[ Applause ]

00:02:07.667 --> 00:02:09.167
You couldn't do it.

00:02:12.067 --> 00:02:13.534
And I'm not a bad-looking guy.

00:02:13.534 --> 00:02:16.901
From here on up, you're like,
"Oh, who's that?" You know?

00:02:16.901 --> 00:02:19.167
Right? But here I just got this
going on.

00:02:19.167 --> 00:02:21.567
I always look like you took
a photograph of

00:02:21.567 --> 00:02:24.100
a super-good-looking guy right
when he was at

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.267
the down bounce of
a diving board.

00:02:26.267 --> 00:02:28.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:30.667
Like yes, yes, no.

00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:32.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:32.801 --> 00:02:34.667
Yeah. Ah, thank you.

00:02:37.133 --> 00:02:39.334
But you can't choose where
you store fat on your body.

00:02:39.334 --> 00:02:40.667
Doesn't that suck? Right?

00:02:40.667 --> 00:02:43.567
If I could choose, I'd store it
underneath my feet.

00:02:43.567 --> 00:02:46.000
'Cause then when people are
like, "Dude, how fat are you?"

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.434
I'll be like, "6'4."

00:02:47.434 --> 00:02:48.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:50.601
"I'm so fat, I can dunk, bro."

00:02:50.601 --> 00:02:52.100
I[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:54.133
It just feels good to be here.

00:02:54.133 --> 00:02:56.367
It feels good to connect with
people again, you know?

00:02:56.367 --> 00:02:58.133
I love connecting.
That's my favorite thing.

00:02:58.133 --> 00:03:00.167
I was talking to this guy
after my show.

00:03:00.167 --> 00:03:01.767
He was this big, burly
biker dude.

00:03:01.767 --> 00:03:04.334
Teardrop tattoo, right?
We all know what that means.

00:03:04.334 --> 00:03:06.100
I'm just trying to connect.
I'm like, "Ah, I've been

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:07.467
thinking about
getting one of those."

00:03:07.467 --> 00:03:09.133
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.133 --> 00:03:11.000
"Oh, I am a cryer."

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:14.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:17.167
Oh, yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:18.934 --> 00:03:21.167
I was like, "Have you seen
the movie 'The Notebook?'"

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:25.501
[ Laughter ]
"If you're a bird, I'm a bird."

00:03:25.501 --> 00:03:28.434
Yeah, I like to choose kindness.

00:03:28.434 --> 00:03:30.834
I'll tell you what.
I would never ghost a gal.

00:03:30.834 --> 00:03:33.601
Do you guys know what
ghosting a gal is?

00:03:33.601 --> 00:03:35.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.067 --> 00:03:36.834
Well, there's lots of different
variations nowadays.

00:03:36.834 --> 00:03:40.400
But traditionally speaking it's
where a man has sex with a lady

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.334
and afterwards
he never calls her,

00:03:42.334 --> 00:03:44.100
texts her, or sees her again.

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:46.501
He just vanishes like a ghost.

00:03:46.501 --> 00:03:48.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.534 --> 00:03:50.434
Yeah, well, let me tell you
what, fellas.

00:03:50.434 --> 00:03:51.968
Don't do that.
That is rude business.

00:03:51.968 --> 00:03:53.467
Put the power in her hands.

00:03:53.467 --> 00:03:55.067
Don't ghost. Smother.

00:03:55.067 --> 00:03:57.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.501 --> 00:03:59.167
It's way more effective.

00:03:59.167 --> 00:04:00.567
[ Laughter ]

00:04:00.567 --> 00:04:02.634
Next time you have sex with that
lady for the first time,

00:04:02.634 --> 00:04:03.968
she falls sleep next to you,

00:04:03.968 --> 00:04:05.567
send her an accidental
text message.

00:04:05.567 --> 00:04:07.267
Send her a text message that
says,

00:04:07.267 --> 00:04:09.000
"Hey, Mom, think I met the one."

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:14.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:15.767
Yeah.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:21.067
"I can't be too sure, but I'm
watching her sleep right now."

00:04:21.067 --> 00:04:22.701
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.701 --> 00:04:25.734
As soon as she wakes up, as soon
as her peepers flutter open,

00:04:25.734 --> 00:04:29.467
your head needs to be right
there and go, "Hey, guess what."

00:04:29.467 --> 00:04:30.567
And she'll be like, "What?"
And you'll be like,

00:04:30.567 --> 00:04:32.267
"Forever starts right now."

00:04:32.267 --> 00:04:35.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:35.067 --> 00:04:38.734
Yeah. Yeah.

00:04:38.734 --> 00:04:40.534
You'll be single like that.

00:04:40.534 --> 00:04:41.434
[ Laughter ]

00:04:41.434 --> 00:04:43.701
Yeah. Don't ghost. Haunt.

00:04:43.701 --> 00:04:45.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:45.968 --> 00:04:48.100
Alright, you guys, I'm Pete Lee.
Thanks for being a great crowd.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.133
Thank you very much.

